    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Tom Coolen, working as Mad Leif: graphic designer and digital illustrator based in Hasselt, Belgium. Work leans into nature, psychedelia and futuristic nostalgia; known for gradient/colour-field poster illustrations and abstract prints. Sells prints via East Side Studio London, Society6, and grafik.net. Published illustration for Wired Magazine Mind Grenades series (2019, art directed by Alyssa Walker). Also teaches on Domestika (5 courses). LinkedIn lists him as Creative Director of own Mad Leif practice (b. 1983, so ~15+ yrs, senior independent). Autonomy 5: solo self-directed studio-of-one. Freelance/self-employed per LinkedIn and self-maintained IG. Note: madleif.com domain has lapsed (redirects to Adobe Portfolio missing page as of 2026-06-28); Behance (behance.net/tomcoolen) and IG (@mad.leif, 22K followers) are active primary surfaces. Work captured from Behance (Posters Vol 1 Parts 3+5, Sorrows, Wired) and East Side Studio London (Optics, Atardecer, Absolver prints). IG logged-in capture not attempted (no throttle budget); IG grid accessible logged-out.",
